 Anthropic is cutting ties with the Information Technology Industry Council, an industry advocacy group, over legislation that would curb foreign access to U.S. chips, as Maria Curi scooped yesterday. (Axios) Another scoop from Maria: The Trump administration's new AI framework lacks guidelines for reporting incidents caused by advanced models before they're released. (Axios) Qualcomm struck a deal to help Amazon with its chips, also giving the tech giant the opportunity to purchase $4 billion in Qualcomm stock. (CNBC) 
 
